From 10530f20a2846ab7ba1cd09a3a5492a84036a7e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moritz Angermann <moritz@zw3rk.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:37:08 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] compile: extend .hs-boot knot-tying, cache handling, and
 record-selector aliases

Refs: https://github.com/augustss/MicroHs/issues/278

Extend mutual .hs-boot compilation, cache invalidation/reloading,
abstraction, and desugaring (including .hs-boot record-selector link aliases)
so GHC's 450+ module mutually recursive .hs-boot graph compiles cleanly.
